#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:8
msgid "Local storage unavailable"
msgstr "Stockage local indisponible"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:13
msgid "Close another open dictionary tab and reload."
msgstr "Fermez un autre onglet du dictionnaire et rechargez la page."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:58
msgid ""
"Not saved to the dictionary yet. A recovery draft is stored on this device. "
"Choose Save when ready."
msgstr ""
"Pas encore enregistré dans le dictionnaire. Un brouillon de secours est "
"conservé sur cet appareil. Choisissez Enregistrer quand vous êtes prêt."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:60
msgid ""
"Not saved. Draft recovery is unavailable on this device. Keep this page open"
" and choose Save."
msgstr ""
"Non enregistré. La récupération des brouillons est indisponible sur cet "
"appareil. Gardez cette page ouverte et choisissez Enregistrer."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:65
msgid "Not saved to the dictionary. Preparing a recovery draft…"
msgstr ""
"Non enregistré dans le dictionnaire. Préparation d’un brouillon de secours…"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:121
msgid ""
"This file is larger than 15 MB. Choose a shorter recording or a smaller "
"picture."
msgstr ""
"Ce fichier dépasse 15 Mo. Choisissez un enregistrement plus court ou une "
"image plus petite."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:146
msgid ""
"Draft restored on this device. Not confirmed as saved to the dictionary. "
"Choose Save when ready."
msgstr ""
"Brouillon restauré sur cet appareil. Son enregistrement dans le dictionnaire"
" n’est pas confirmé. Choisissez Enregistrer quand vous êtes prêt."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:148
msgid ""
"Draft recovery is unavailable on this device. Keep this page open until you "
"save."
msgstr ""
"La récupération des brouillons est indisponible sur cet appareil. Gardez "
"cette page ouverte jusqu’à l’enregistrement."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:164
msgid "Finish recording or stop the microphone check first."
msgstr "Terminez d’abord l’enregistrement ou arrêtez le test du microphone."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:165
msgid ""
"Discard the draft stored on this device? This does not remove anything "
"already saved to the dictionary."
msgstr ""
"Supprimer le brouillon conservé sur cet appareil ? Cela ne supprime rien de "
"ce qui est déjà enregistré dans le dictionnaire."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:169
msgid "Could not remove the recovery draft. Keep editing or try again."
msgstr ""
"Impossible de supprimer le brouillon de secours. Continuez à modifier ou "
"réessayez."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:175
msgid "Finish recording or stop the microphone check before saving."
msgstr ""
"Terminez l’enregistrement ou arrêtez le test du microphone avant "
"d’enregistrer."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:186
msgid "Saving to the dictionary… waiting for confirmation."
msgstr "Enregistrement dans le dictionnaire… en attente de confirmation."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:203
msgid ""
"The upload is too large for this server. Try a smaller picture or recording."
msgstr ""
"Le fichier est trop volumineux pour ce serveur. Essayez une image ou un "
"enregistrement plus petit."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:203
msgid ""
"Your session may have expired, or the server could not respond. Your draft "
"remains here. Reload or sign in, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Votre session a peut-être expiré, ou le serveur n’a pas pu répondre. Votre "
"brouillon reste ici. Rechargez la page ou connectez-vous, puis réessayez."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:205
msgid "The server could not save this yet."
msgstr "Le serveur n’a pas encore pu enregistrer ce contenu."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:208
msgid "Saved to the dictionary."
msgstr "Enregistré dans le dictionnaire."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:212
msgid ""
"Confirmation took too long. You can retry safely: the same submission will "
"not be added twice."
msgstr ""
"La confirmation a pris trop de temps. Vous pouvez réessayer sans risque : le"
" même envoi ne sera pas ajouté deux fois."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:212
msgid "Connection lost. Keep this page open or restore the draft and retry."
msgstr ""
"Connexion perdue. Gardez cette page ouverte ou restaurez le brouillon, puis "
"réessayez."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:213
msgid ""
"Not confirmed as saved. Your contribution is still here; choose Save to "
"retry when connected."
msgstr ""
"Enregistrement non confirmé. Votre contribution est toujours ici ; "
"choisissez Enregistrer pour réessayer une fois connecté."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:225
msgid "Saving is in progress. Please wait for confirmation."
msgstr "L’enregistrement est en cours. Veuillez attendre la confirmation."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/app.js:226
msgid "Finish recording or stop the microphone check before leaving."
msgstr ""
"Terminez l’enregistrement ou arrêtez le test du microphone avant de quitter "
"la page."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/capture.js:31
msgid "Language for feedback"
msgstr "Langue des commentaires"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/capture.js:31
msgid "Language I am using"
msgstr "Langue que j’utilise"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/capture.js:71
msgid "Keep up to 12 words or expressions for this picture."
msgstr "Gardez jusqu’à 12 mots ou expressions pour cette image."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/capture.js:91
msgid ""
"Audio is still pending. You can continue to another picture, refresh its "
"status later, or use Continue creating audio."
msgstr ""
"L’audio est toujours en attente. Vous pouvez passer à une autre image, "
"actualiser son état plus tard ou utiliser « Continuer la création audio »."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/capture.js:95
msgid ""
"Could not refresh the audio status. Your saved picture is safe. Reload to "
"check progress."
msgstr ""
"Impossible d’actualiser l’état de l’audio. Votre image est bien enregistrée."
" Rechargez la page pour voir la progression."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/capture.js:107
msgid "Could not refresh the audio status."
msgstr "Impossible d’actualiser l’état de l’audio."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/capture.js:109
msgid "This preview is no longer available. Reload to view the current entry."
msgstr ""
"Cet aperçu n’est plus disponible. Rechargez la page pour voir l’entrée "
"actuelle."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/capture.js:126
msgid ""
"Audio is being prepared in the background. You can continue using this page "
"or go to the next picture."
msgstr ""
"L’audio est en cours de préparation en arrière-plan. Vous pouvez continuer à"
" utiliser cette page ou passer à l’image suivante."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/capture.js:142
msgid ""
"Working… Your saved picture is safe. Audio continues in the background when "
"the worker is running."
msgstr ""
"Traitement en cours… Votre image est bien enregistrée. La création audio "
"continue en arrière-plan lorsque le processus de traitement est actif."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/capture.js:146
msgid "The request could not finish."
msgstr "La demande n’a pas pu aboutir."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/capture.js:149
msgid "Connection interrupted."
msgstr "Connexion interrompue."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/capture.js:149
msgid ""
"Reload to check the result; an in-flight request will not be repeated "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Rechargez la page pour vérifier le résultat ; une demande en cours ne sera "
"pas répétée automatiquement."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/capture.js:156
msgid ""
"Audio is being prepared in the background. You can go to the next picture."
msgstr ""
"L’audio est en cours de préparation en arrière-plan. Vous pouvez passer à "
"l’image suivante."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/evaluation.js:10
msgid "Unsaved judgements. Choose Save and next before leaving."
msgstr ""
"Avis non enregistrés. Choisissez Enregistrer et continuer avant de quitter."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/lexicon.js:25
msgid "Pause"
msgstr "Pause"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/lexicon.js:25
msgid "Listen"
msgstr "Écouter"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/lexicon.js:26
msgid "Pause %(word)s"
msgstr "Mettre %(word)s en pause"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/lexicon.js:26
msgid "Listen to %(word)s"
msgstr "Écouter %(word)s"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/lexicon.js:30
msgid ""
"This recording could not play. Try again, or open the word page for other "
"recordings."
msgstr ""
"Impossible de lire cet enregistrement. Réessayez ou ouvrez la page du mot "
"pour trouver d’autres enregistrements."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/lexicon.js:98
msgid ""
"Could not refresh recordings. Reload this page to check for saved audio."
msgstr ""
"Impossible d’actualiser les enregistrements. Rechargez cette page pour "
"vérifier les enregistrements sauvegardés."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/photo.js:21
msgid "Uploading and identifying… Please keep this page open."
msgstr "Envoi et identification… Gardez cette page ouverte."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/photo.js:49
msgid ""
"The connection was interrupted. Open “Learn from a photo” again and check "
"Your recent photos before starting another attempt."
msgstr ""
"La connexion a été interrompue. Rouvrez « Apprendre avec une photo » et "
"consultez Vos photos récentes avant de réessayer."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/photo.js:64
msgid ""
"Synthetic preview using an available device voice. No recording is saved. "
"Your device’s speech service may process the word."
msgstr ""
"Aperçu de synthèse avec une voix disponible sur votre appareil. Aucun "
"enregistrement n’est conservé. Le service vocal de votre appareil peut "
"traiter le mot."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/photo.js:64
msgid ""
"No matching device voice is available. You can add a human recording after "
"saving."
msgstr ""
"Aucune voix adaptée n’est disponible sur l’appareil. Vous pouvez ajouter un "
"enregistrement humain après avoir enregistré la fiche."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/photo.js:73
msgid "The device voice could not play. You can add a recording after saving."
msgstr ""
"La voix de l’appareil n’a pas pu être lue. Vous pouvez ajouter un "
"enregistrement après avoir enregistré la fiche."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:39
msgid "The connection is taking too long. Please try again."
msgstr "La connexion prend trop de temps. Veuillez réessayer."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:39
msgid "Unable to reach the dictionary. Reconnect and start a new activity."
msgstr ""
"Impossible de joindre le dictionnaire. Reconnectez-vous et démarrez une "
"nouvelle activité."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:41
msgid "This dictionary is no longer available. Return to the dictionary list."
msgstr ""
"Ce dictionnaire n’est plus disponible. Revenez à la liste des dictionnaires."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:42
msgid "Unable to check the dictionary. Please try again when connected."
msgstr "Impossible de vérifier le dictionnaire. Réessayez une fois connecté."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:44
msgid "Unable to start this activity. Please try again."
msgstr "Impossible de démarrer cette activité. Veuillez réessayer."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:53
msgid ""
"The dictionary changed. Choose an activity to practise with the current "
"shared content."
msgstr ""
"Le dictionnaire a changé. Choisissez une activité pour travailler avec le "
"contenu partagé actuel."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:57
msgid "The connection is taking too long. Reconnect and start a new activity."
msgstr ""
"La connexion prend trop de temps. Reconnectez-vous et démarrez une nouvelle "
"activité."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:57
msgid "Connection lost. Reconnect and start a new activity."
msgstr "Connexion perdue. Reconnectez-vous et démarrez une nouvelle activité."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:70
msgid "Dictionary picture"
msgstr "Image du dictionnaire"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:71
msgid "AI-generated picture"
msgstr "Image générée par l’IA"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:72
msgid ""
"This picture could not be loaded. You can skip it or start another activity."
msgstr ""
"Cette image n’a pas pu être chargée. Vous pouvez la passer ou démarrer une "
"autre activité."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:75
msgid "Dictionary recording"
msgstr "Enregistrement du dictionnaire"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:77
msgid ""
"This recording could not be played. You can skip it or try another browser."
msgstr ""
"Cet enregistrement n’a pas pu être lu. Vous pouvez le passer ou essayer un "
"autre navigateur."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:78
msgid "Synthetic voice"
msgstr "Voix de synthèse"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:83
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "Traduction"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:86
msgid "Visit word page"
msgstr "Voir la page du mot"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:86
msgid "Visit entry"
msgstr "Voir la fiche"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:91
msgid "%(learned)s of %(total)s remembered · %(remaining)s left"
msgstr "%(learned)s retenues sur %(total)s · %(remaining)s restantes"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:93
msgid "Well done!"
msgstr "Bravo !"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:93
msgid "You recalled %(total)s cards."
msgstr "Vous avez retenu %(total)s cartes."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:93
#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:118
msgid "Practise again"
msgstr "S’entraîner à nouveau"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:97
msgid "Recall the word or phrase."
msgstr "Retrouvez le mot ou l’expression."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:97
msgid "Recall the picture."
msgstr "Retrouvez l’image."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:97
msgid "Recall the pronunciation."
msgstr "Retrouvez la prononciation."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:101
#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:166
#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:227
msgid "Show answer"
msgstr "Afficher la réponse"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:104
msgid "Again"
msgstr "Revoir"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:104
msgid "Got it"
msgstr "Retenu"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:106
#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:166
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Passer"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:115
msgid "%(completed)s of %(total)s completed · %(correct)s correct first time"
msgstr ""
"%(completed)s terminées sur %(total)s · %(correct)s bonnes réponses du "
"premier coup"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:118
msgid "Session complete"
msgstr "Séance terminée"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:118
msgid "%(correct)s of %(total)s correct first time."
msgstr "%(correct)s bonnes réponses du premier coup sur %(total)s."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:123
msgid "Choose the matching word or phrase."
msgstr "Choisissez le mot ou l’expression qui correspond."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:123
msgid "Choose the matching picture."
msgstr "Choisissez l’image qui correspond."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:123
msgid "Choose the matching recording."
msgstr "Choisissez l’enregistrement qui correspond."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:125
#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:224
msgid "Correct!"
msgstr "Correct !"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:125
msgid "Answer shown."
msgstr "Réponse affichée."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:125
msgid "Not this one. Try another, or show the answer."
msgstr ""
"Ce n’est pas celle-ci. Essayez une autre réponse ou affichez la réponse."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:127
msgid "Answer choices"
msgstr "Choix de réponses"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:144
msgid "Choose picture %(label)s"
msgstr "Choisir l’image %(label)s"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:145
msgid "Choose %(label)s"
msgstr "Choisir %(label)s"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:147
msgid "Recording %(label)s"
msgstr "Enregistrement %(label)s"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:149
msgid "Choose recording %(label)s"
msgstr "Choisir l’enregistrement %(label)s"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:153
msgid "✓ Matching answer"
msgstr "✓ Bonne réponse"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:154
msgid "Try another answer"
msgstr "Essayer une autre réponse"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:164
msgid "Next card"
msgstr "Carte suivante"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:176
msgid ""
"%(completed)s of %(total)s completed · %(remembered)s solved without showing"
" the answer"
msgstr ""
"%(completed)s terminés sur %(total)s · %(remembered)s résolus sans afficher "
"la réponse"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:181
msgid "Crossword grid"
msgstr "Grille de mots croisés"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:181
msgid "Word search grid"
msgstr "Grille de mots mêlés"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:195
msgid "Row %(row)s, column %(column)s%(letter)s"
msgstr "Ligne %(row)s, colonne %(column)s%(letter)s"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:206
msgid "Fit grid"
msgstr "Adapter la grille"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:206
msgid "Larger grid"
msgstr "Agrandir la grille"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:209
msgid "%(number)s%(direction)s · %(letters)s letters"
msgstr "%(number)s%(direction)s · %(letters)s lettres"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:212
msgid "Type the word for this picture. Spaces and punctuation are not needed."
msgstr ""
"Saisissez le mot correspondant à cette image. Les espaces et la ponctuation "
"ne sont pas nécessaires."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:212
msgid ""
"Tap the first letter, then the last letter of the word. It can go across, "
"down or diagonally."
msgstr ""
"Touchez la première lettre, puis la dernière lettre du mot. Il peut être "
"horizontal, vertical ou en diagonale."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:215
msgid "Answer shown"
msgstr "Réponse affichée"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:215
msgid "Found!"
msgstr "Trouvé !"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:220
msgid "Your answer"
msgstr "Votre réponse"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:222
msgid "Check answer"
msgstr "Vérifier la réponse"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:224
msgid "Not quite. Try again, or show the answer."
msgstr "Pas tout à fait. Réessayez ou affichez la réponse."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:230
msgid "Previous clue"
msgstr "Indice précédent"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:230
msgid "Next clue"
msgstr "Indice suivant"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:232
msgid "Choose a picture clue"
msgstr "Choisir un indice en image"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:234
msgid "Puzzle complete"
msgstr "Grille terminée"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:234
msgid "New puzzle"
msgstr "Nouvelle grille"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:237
msgid "Now tap the last letter."
msgstr "Touchez maintenant la dernière lettre."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:239
msgid "Choose a straight line of letters."
msgstr "Choisissez une ligne droite de lettres."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:245
msgid "Not one of these words yet. Try again."
msgstr "Ce n’est pas l’un de ces mots. Réessayez."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:249
msgid "Found it!"
msgstr "Trouvé !"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:255
msgid "Preparing your activity…"
msgstr "Préparation de votre activité…"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:259
msgid ""
"No cards have both kinds of content yet. Choose another direction or add the"
" missing pictures, words or recordings."
msgstr ""
"Aucune carte ne contient encore les deux types de contenu. Choisissez un "
"autre sens ou ajoutez les images, mots ou enregistrements manquants."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:263
msgid "Flashcards"
msgstr "Cartes mémoire"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:263
msgid "Picture crossword"
msgstr "Mots croisés en images"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:263
msgid "Word scramble"
msgstr "Mots mêlés"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:266
msgid "Unable to connect. Please try again."
msgstr "Impossible de se connecter. Veuillez réessayer."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/practice.js:280
msgid "Choose an activity to use the latest shared content."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez une activité pour utiliser le contenu partagé le plus récent."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/recorder.js:28
msgid "■ Stop recording"
msgstr "■ Arrêter l’enregistrement"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/recorder.js:28
msgid "● Record"
msgstr "● Enregistrer"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/recorder.js:31
msgid "Stop microphone check"
msgstr "Arrêter le test du microphone"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/recorder.js:31
msgid "Check microphone"
msgstr "Tester le microphone"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/recorder.js:39
msgid "Browser default microphone"
msgstr "Microphone par défaut du navigateur"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/recorder.js:41
msgid "Microphone %(number)s"
msgstr "Microphone %(number)s"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/recorder.js:49
msgid "Use Check microphone to test this input."
msgstr "Utilisez Tester le microphone pour vérifier cette entrée."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/recorder.js:52
msgid ""
"Microphone access was not allowed. Check microphone permissions in the "
"browser site settings and on your device, then try again."
msgstr ""
"L’accès au microphone n’a pas été autorisé. Vérifiez les autorisations du "
"microphone dans les paramètres du site et de votre appareil, puis réessayez."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/recorder.js:53
msgid ""
"The selected microphone is unavailable. Choose another input or reconnect "
"it, then check again."
msgstr ""
"Le microphone choisi est indisponible. Choisissez une autre entrée ou "
"reconnectez-le, puis refaites le test."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/recorder.js:54
msgid ""
"The microphone could not be opened. Close other recording or calling apps, "
"then try again or choose another microphone."
msgstr ""
"Impossible d’accéder au microphone. Fermez les autres applications "
"d’enregistrement ou d’appel, puis réessayez ou choisissez un autre "
"microphone."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/recorder.js:55
msgid ""
"Recording could not start. Check the selected microphone, or choose an "
"existing audio file."
msgstr ""
"L’enregistrement n’a pas pu démarrer. Vérifiez le microphone choisi ou "
"sélectionnez un fichier audio existant."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/recorder.js:73
msgid "Input meter unavailable; listen to the finished recording."
msgstr "Indicateur de niveau indisponible ; écoutez l’enregistrement terminé."

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/recorder.js:82
msgid "Sound detected"
msgstr "Son détecté"

#: community_dictionary/static/community_dictionary/recorder.js:82
